{"seq":1,"slug":"parcel-lifecycle-state-model","title":"跨境包裹末端生命周期与柜内状态机建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-parcel-locker-pudo-network/parcel-flow-routing-engine/parcel-lifecycle-state-model","wordCount":2803,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨境包裹末端生命周期与柜内状态机建模\">跨境包裹末端生命周期与柜内状态机建模</h1><p>一辆 DHL 干线车在凌晨三点停到华沙某台格口柜前，司机把二十件跨境包裹一次性塞进柜体，其中三件因为超出当前可用格口尺寸被原车带回。四十八小时后，一件无人领取的包裹被系统标记超期，格口要释放给新到的车次。装载、拒收、超期回收这三个动作分别属于三套互相咬合的状态机：包裹的业务生命周期、格口的物理占用状态、柜体的设备健康状态。把三者混成一个 <code>status</code> 字段，是末端系统最常见的建模错误——它会让&quot;包裹还在柜里&quot;和&quot;格口已经被占&quot;这类事实冲突在第一次对账时集中爆发。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>末端系统的状态不是一个，而是<strong>三个独立演进的有限状态机</strong>，它们只在明确边界上通过事件耦合。</p>\n<p><strong>第一台，包裹业务生命周期机。</strong> 描述&quot;这票货在物流链的哪个环节&quot;，由上游清关、干线运输和末端节点共同推进，终态是已取件或已退回；迁移由业务判定驱动，与物理位置无关。</p>\n<p><strong>第二台，格口占用状态机。</strong> 描述&quot;这个物理格口现在是空的、被预留的、还是装有东西&quot;，其状态只由柜机的门锁与传感器事件驱动——开门、关门、锁止、检测到物体。</p>\n<p><strong>第三台，柜体设备健康机。</strong> 描述&quot;整机是否在线、是否可服务&quot;，因断电、通信中断、门锁或传感器故障而进入降级状态，此时前两台机都要被冻结或迁移到安全状态。</p>\n<p>三台机<strong>耦合而非合并</strong>：包裹状态不能推导格口状态（包裹在柜里但传感器未上报），格口状态也不能推导包裹状态（格口被占可能因上一件包裹未被正确签收）。三者的交互如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[清关完成&lt;br/&gt;进口放行] --&gt; B[目的国干线枢纽&lt;br/&gt;HUB_INBOUND]&#10;    B --&gt; C[干线转运&lt;br/&gt;LINEHAUL]&#10;    C --&gt; D{到达末端节点}&#10;    D --&gt;|尺寸与合规匹配| E[装载入格&lt;br/&gt;STORED]&#10;    D --&gt;|超尺寸或需人工核验| F[柜台寄存&lt;br/&gt;COUNTER_HELD]&#10;    E --&gt; G[可取件&lt;br/&gt;READY_FOR_PICKUP]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H{用户行为}&#10;    H --&gt;|扫码取件| I[已取件&lt;br/&gt;PICKED_UP]&#10;    H --&gt;|保管期届满| J[超期&lt;br/&gt;EXPIRED]&#10;    J --&gt; K[回收退回&lt;br/&gt;RETURN_TO_SENDER]&#10;    I --&gt; L[终态]&#10;    K --&gt; L&#10;    E -.格口故障冻结.-&gt; M[设备异常&lt;br/&gt;DEVICE_FAULT]&#10;    M -.恢复后重放.-&gt; G\">graph TD\n    A[清关完成&lt;br/&gt;进口放行] --&gt; B[目的国干线枢纽&lt;br/&gt;HUB_INBOUND]\n    B --&gt; C[干线转运&lt;br/&gt;LINEHAUL]\n    C --&gt; D{到达末端节点}\n    D --&gt;|尺寸与合规匹配| E[装载入格&lt;br/&gt;STORED]\n    D --&gt;|超尺寸或需人工核验| F[柜台寄存&lt;br/&gt;COUNTER_HELD]\n    E --&gt; G[可取件&lt;br/&gt;READY_FOR_PICKUP]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H{用户行为}\n    H --&gt;|扫码取件| I[已取件&lt;br/&gt;PICKED_UP]\n    H --&gt;|保管期届满| J[超期&lt;br/&gt;EXPIRED]\n    J --&gt; K[回收退回&lt;br/&gt;RETURN_TO_SENDER]\n    I --&gt; L[终态]\n    K --&gt; L\n    E -.格口故障冻结.-&gt; M[设备异常&lt;br/&gt;DEVICE_FAULT]\n    M -.恢复后重放.-&gt; G</pre><p>工程上必须守住的一条边界是：<strong>包裹状态机只对业务负责，格口状态机只对物理负责</strong>。任何&quot;因为格口满了所以包裹状态改成失败&quot;的写法，都会在高峰期把可恢复的排队问题写成不可恢复的数据损坏。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>包裹业务生命周期</th>\n<th>格口占用状态</th>\n<th>柜体设备健康</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>驱动源</td>\n<td>清关/干线/用户行为事件</td>\n<td>门锁、开合、传感器事件</td>\n<td>心跳、自检、功耗上报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态数</td>\n<td>8–12</td>\n<td>5–6</td>\n<td>4–5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间尺度</td>\n<td>天</td>\n<td>小时–天</td>\n<td>秒–分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权威出处</td>\n<td>GS1 EPCIS 2.0 事件词汇（<code>bizStep</code> / <code>disposition</code>，ISO/IEC 19987:2024 采纳）</td>\n<td>CEN/TS 17400 柜机互操作语义</td>\n<td>运营商设备规格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>终态</td>\n<td>已取件 / 已退回</td>\n<td>释放 / 永久锁定</td>\n<td>退役</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败代价</td>\n<td>对账错、错退件</td>\n<td>格口泄漏（可用数虚高）</td>\n<td>整柜不可服务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"跨境末端生命周期状态建模\">跨境末端生命周期状态建模</h2><p>把包裹生命周期写成状态集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 与事件字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span></span></span></span></span> 上的确定有限自动机：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>δ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>δ</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mo>⇀</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M = (S,\\; \\Sigma,\\; \\delta,\\; s_0,\\; F),\\qquad \\delta: S \\times \\Sigma \\rightharpoonup S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇀</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>部分函数</strong>——不是任意状态都能被任意事件触发迁移。这正是状态机的价值：非法迁移（如&quot;已取件&quot;又收到&quot;装载入格&quot;）必须被显式拒绝，而非静默接受。</p>\n<p>跨境场景与国内最大的不同在于，<strong>&quot;进口清关完成&quot;必须是 <code>LINEHAUL</code> 的前置守卫</strong>。包裹进入末端节点之前已完成清关，因此末端状态机不应包含&quot;待清关&quot;状态；一旦把它混进来，柜机就会被要求承载海关权限，这在任何监管框架下都不成立。末端与清关的边界应落在 <code>HUB_INBOUND</code> 这个状态上。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>触发事件</th>\n<th>守卫条件</th>\n<th>后继</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>ARRIVED_AT_HUB</code></td>\n<td>目的国枢纽到件扫描</td>\n<td>进口清关已放行</td>\n<td><code>LINEHAUL</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>LINEHAUL</code></td>\n<td>干线发车扫描</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td><code>INBOUND_AT_NODE</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>INBOUND_AT_NODE</code></td>\n<td>末端节点到件扫描</td>\n<td>节点在线、面单可读</td>\n<td><code>STORED</code> / <code>COUNTER_HELD</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>STORED</code></td>\n<td>格口关门并锁止</td>\n<td>格口状态为 <code>OCCUPIED</code> 且尺寸匹配</td>\n<td><code>READY_FOR_PICKUP</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>COUNTER_HELD</code></td>\n<td>柜台签收</td>\n<td>暂存空间未超限</td>\n<td><code>READY_FOR_PICKUP</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>READY_FOR_PICKUP</code></td>\n<td>取件码生成并推送</td>\n<td>通知渠道可用</td>\n<td><code>PICKED_UP</code> / <code>EXPIRED</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>PICKED_UP</code></td>\n<td>取件码验证通过且门已关</td>\n<td>取件码未过期</td>\n<td>终态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>EXPIRED</code></td>\n<td>系统定时扫描：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{now} &gt; t_{stored} + T_{hold}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>无未决争议工单</td>\n<td><code>RETURN_TO_SENDER</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>RETURN_TO_SENDER</code></td>\n<td>逆向面单生成并入柜/交车</td>\n<td>逆向路由可用</td>\n<td>终态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>超期判定的形式化表达很朴素，但工程实现里有三个陷阱：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>EXPIRED</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>no_open_dispute</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{expire} = t_{stored} + T_{hold},\\qquad \\text{EXPIRED} \\iff t_{now} \\ge t_{expire} \\;\\wedge\\; \\text{no\\_open\\_dispute}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EXPIRED</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">no_open_dispute</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>陷阱一，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t\\_{stored}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span> 必须取物理入格时间</strong>，而非 <code>READY_FOR_PICKUP</code> 时间——两者可能因通知故障相差数小时，用后者会无声延长保管期。<strong>陷阱二，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T\\_{hold}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span> 因节点类型而异</strong>：无人柜机的公开条款通常为 48 小时至 7 天（DHL Packstation 为 7 天，InPost 柜机约 48 小时），有人柜台则需扣除闭店时间。<strong>陷阱三，超期扫描必须幂等</strong>——定时任务重跑不能产生两条 <code>EXPIRED</code> 事件，否则会生成两张逆向面单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"格口占用状态机与耦合不变量\">格口占用状态机与耦合不变量</h2><p>格口状态机比包裹机简单，但<strong>故障模式更隐蔽</strong>。其状态集合通常是 <code>FREE → RESERVED → OCCUPIED → RELEASED</code>，外加一个 <code>BLOCKED</code> 表故障或人工锁定。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>FREE → RESERVED</code>：路由引擎为一件即将到站的包裹预留格口。预留必须有<strong>超时</strong>，否则一辆延误的车会永久占住格口。</li>\n<li><code>RESERVED → OCCUPIED</code>：门开、包裹放入、门关、锁止传感器确认。</li>\n<li><code>OCCUPIED → RELEASED</code>：取件或回收后关门，且<strong>柜内重量/体积传感器确认已空</strong>。</li>\n<li>任意状态 <code>→ BLOCKED</code>：门锁故障，或传感器持续报占用但无对应包裹。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关键在于 <code>OCCUPIED → RELEASED</code> 的守卫不能只看&quot;门关上了&quot;。柜机最常见的现场故障是<strong>包裹被取出后又塞回杂物</strong>，或<strong>传感器漂移导致空柜被报为占用</strong>。因此释放条件应写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RELEASE</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>door_closed</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>weight</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>no_open_parcel</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RELEASE} \\iff \\text{door\\_closed} \\;\\wedge\\; (\\text{weight} &lt; w_{empty} + \\epsilon) \\;\\wedge\\; \\text{no\\_open\\_parcel}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7073em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RELEASE</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">door_closed</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">weight</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">no_open_parcel</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这三项共同构成耦合不变量：<strong>格口被释放的前提是它内部的包裹业务状态已经离开 <code>STORED</code></strong>。反向不变量同样成立——<strong>包裹进入终态的前提是它的格口已经 <code>RELEASED</code></strong>。两条不变量联立，才能保证&quot;可用格口数&quot;这个对调度最关键的数字不会虚高。设备健康机在此时介入：一旦整机进入 <code>DEVICE_FAULT</code>，所有 <code>RESERVED</code> 预留应立即释放并回滚路由决策，所有 <code>OCCUPIED</code> 格口冻结在原地，等待恢复后由设备重放本地缓存事件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事件溯源与状态投影\">事件溯源与状态投影</h2><p>末端系统的现实是<strong>事件必然乱序、必然重复、必然丢失</strong>。车上的手持终端可能离线数小时，柜机可能因信号弱而延迟上报。正确的架构不是&quot;更新状态字段&quot;，而是<strong>事件溯源（event sourcing）</strong>：把每次扫描与开合记录为不可变事件，状态是事件的折叠结果。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>state</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>fold</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>e</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mtext> sorted by </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{state}(p, t) = \\text{fold}\\big(\\{\\, e \\in E_p : e.t \\le t \\,\\} \\text{ sorted by } (e.seq)\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">state</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fold</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> sorted by </span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这套做法与国际标准对齐。GS1 的 EPCIS 2.0（2022 年发布，其数据模型被 ISO/IEC 19987:2024 采纳）把物流事件组织为 <code>ObjectEvent</code>、<code>AggregationEvent</code>、<code>TransformationEvent</code>、<code>AssociationEvent</code> 四类，并用受控词汇 <code>bizStep</code>（业务步骤）与 <code>disposition</code>（处置）表达语义。末端场景中，装载入格对应一个 <code>ObjectEvent</code>，<code>bizStep</code> 取存储类词汇；取件对应 <code>disposition</code> 从&quot;在途&quot;变为&quot;已交付&quot;。万国邮政联盟（UPU）的报文标准（M33/M36 系列）与电子预报关数据（EAD）为跨境段提供上游事件源——自 2021 年起 UPU 要求所有国际邮件在寄发时提供 EAD。</p>\n<p>实现上有四条必须守住的规则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>每个事件带全局唯一的 <code>event_id</code> 与单调递增的 <code>seq</code>。</strong> 去重按 <code>event_id</code>，排序按 <code>(node_id, seq)</code>；缺 <code>seq</code> 时退化为本地时钟加逻辑时钟（如 Lamport 计数器）。</li>\n<li><strong>事件必须幂等消费。</strong> 折叠函数对重复事件无副作用——这是实现重复上报的唯一正确方式。</li>\n<li><strong>时间戳遵循 ISO 8601 并携带时区偏移。</strong> 跨境跨越多个时区，用本地时间做超期判定会系统性偏差，判定一律换算到 UTC。</li>\n<li><strong>状态投影是可重建的缓存，不是真相源。</strong> 禁止&quot;改状态字段修数据&quot;，正确修法是追加一条纠正事件。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"异常路径与补偿\">异常路径与补偿</h2><p>正常工作流之外，末端系统真正难写的是<strong>补偿</strong>。三类异常占实际工单的绝大多数：</p>\n<p><strong>一是格口故障导致的&quot;包裹在柜中但柜不可用&quot;。</strong> 包裹状态已是 <code>STORED</code>，格口却进入 <code>BLOCKED</code>。物理上包裹还在柜里，因此不能简单改成失败，而应保持包裹状态不变、派生一个人工介入工单，并在可用格口数中剔除该格口。现场维修的&quot;强制释放&quot;必须要求输入工单号并追加显式的 <code>FORCED_RELEASE</code> 事件，而非直接改字段。</p>\n<p><strong>二是超期与取件的竞态。</strong> 用户在超期扫描生成 <code>EXPIRED</code> 的同一分钟发起取件。事件溯源模型按事件序而非墙钟时间裁决：若取件事件 <code>seq</code> 大于超期事件 <code>seq</code>，取件失败、包裹进入退回；反之取件成功，超期事件被撤销（追加 <code>EXPIRED_REVOKED</code>）。<strong>用墙钟时间比较会产生双重终态。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>三是跨境退件的成本约束。</strong> 退回一件跨境包裹的运费常高于其残值，因此系统应支持<strong>本地弃置或捐赠</strong>作为替代终态，预留 <code>ABANDONED</code> 状态并配套合规校验：弃置须满足目的地国对进口货物处置的规定，且税费已结清。</p>\n<p>补偿路径在路由层面还有一处耦合：被拒收（超尺寸、需人工核验）的包裹会分流到有人柜台，推高柜台暂存压力。格口硬件与尺寸档的建模见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../locker-hardware-iot-integration/locker-hardware-compartment-model\">柜体格口硬件模型与传感器分层</a>；节点类型如何决定其占用模型与容量语义见 <a href=\"../pudo-network-model-placement/pudo-network-topology-node-taxonomy\">PUDO 末端网络拓扑与节点类型建模</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>末端系统是<strong>包裹生命周期、格口占用、设备健康三台独立状态机</strong>，只在明确边界上通过事件耦合。</li>\n<li>包裹生命周期用确定有限自动机建模，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 是部分函数——非法迁移必须被显式拒绝；&quot;清关完成&quot;是 <code>LINEHAUL</code> 的前置守卫，末端状态机不承载海关权限。</li>\n<li>超期判定的三个陷阱：<code>t_stored</code> 取物理入格时间、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{hold}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 因节点类型而异、超期扫描必须幂等。</li>\n<li>格口释放须满足&quot;门关 + 重量归零 + 无未决包裹&quot;，耦合不变量保证可用格口数不虚高。</li>\n<li>事件溯源是应对乱序、重复、丢事件的唯一稳健架构，对齐 GS1 EPCIS 2.0 的事件类型与 <code>bizStep</code> / <code>disposition</code> 受控词汇。</li>\n<li>异常补偿的三类主战场：故障格口的冻结与强制释放、超期与取件的竞态（按事件序裁决）、跨境退件成本下的本地弃置终态。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨境包裹末端生命周期与柜内状态机建模","id":"跨境包裹末端生命周期与柜内状态机建模"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境末端生命周期状态建模","id":"跨境末端生命周期状态建模"},{"level":2,"text":"格口占用状态机与耦合不变量","id":"格口占用状态机与耦合不变量"},{"level":2,"text":"事件溯源与状态投影","id":"事件溯源与状态投影"},{"level":2,"text":"异常路径与补偿","id":"异常路径与补偿"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"离线降级、固件 OTA 与远程故障诊断运维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-parcel-locker-pudo-network/locker-hardware-iot-integration/offline-degradation-firmware-ota-ops"},"next":{"title":"格口分配、投递预约与超时释放调度引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-parcel-locker-pudo-network/parcel-flow-routing-engine/compartment-allocation-reservation-engine"}}